# Configuration and Secrets

All environment-specific values must come from validated configuration (e.g. `LIVEKIT_URL`, `LIVEKIT_API_KEY`, `LIVEKIT_API_SECRET`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, Twilio/SIP credentials, DB/Redis URLs, webhook secrets, log level, environment name).

At startup: validate required variables, fail fast with a clear error, never print secrets, never commit `.env` files, keep `.env.example` updated with variable names only.

Use a typed settings class rather than reading environment variables throughout the codebase.
